{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53277","headline":"诗偈 一○二 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 一○二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有（《祖堂集》卷十五作「世」）人嫌庞老，庞老不嫌他（《祖庭事苑》卷二作「它」）。\n开门待知识，知识不来过。\n心如具三学，尘识不相和（《祖堂集》无此二句）。\n一丸疗万（《祖堂集》作「百」）病，不假药方多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}